WEBVTT

00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:05.490
Versatility is what made Bob Segrin the first superstars champion.

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:09.410
Versatility makes the full line of 3M copiers superstars.

00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:14.910
Versatility to both of these superstars means having the speed to set them ahead of their competition,

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:21.680
like the fastest first copy of any plain paper copier, or cycling the mile in under three minutes.

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:30.000
It means the confidence to handle new challenges, like sending a copy by phone in four minutes, or playing tennis on a highly competitive level.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:38.340
It means the ability to reduce oversize originals to letter-sized copies or reduce time and motion to conquer the challenge of swimming.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:46.210
It means the ability to dial a copy length from 5 to 14 inches or the stamina to win the 100 or the half mile.

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:50.090
That's what versatility means to the superstars.

00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:52.570
Don't you guys ever quit.

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:55.910
Now 3M challenges you to compare.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:59.250
Before you buy or lease any copier, call us.
